sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User Client
  participant S as NextChat Server
  participant M as Middleware / Proxy
  participant P as Provider (OpenAI/Azure/...)
  U->>S: Send chat request (model, prompt, optional user key)
  S->>M: Validate env (CODE, HIDE_USER_API_KEY), apply settings
  alt ENABLE_MCP = true
    M->>P: Send request with MCP context
  else
    M->>P: Send standard request
  end
  P-->>M: Streamed response / completion
  M-->>S: Forward result (handle tokens, streaming)
  S-->>U: Render streamed reply to user
